// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// The matrix self-checks (§17.2, §17.3, exploration §7.2/§7.4).
//
// Two mechanical assertions live here, and this file owns both:
//
//  1. every T cell this PACKAGE owns has exactly one owning test file, and
//     every AC those cells carry is cited by at least one of them;
//  2. the real-Git leaf count of the reparent suite stays within the §17.3
//     budget, MEASURED rather than estimated.
//
// The package boundary is load-bearing. Go test files compile into the package
// they declare, so the package-internal cells (T-004…T-026, T-031…T-036,
// T-057…T-060, T-081…T-084) are owned by internal/reparent_*_test.go and are
// deliberately NOT claimed here. The counter lives in package cli because the
// CLI-level leaves are the majority.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

// reparentCellOwner maps each T cell this package owns to its single owning
// file. A cell listed twice, or listed against a file that does not contain
// it, fails the assertion.
var reparentCellOwner = map[string]string{
	"T-001": "reparent_e2e_test.go",
	"T-002": "reparent_e2e_test.go",
	"T-003": "reparent_e2e_test.go",
